    0,\n    \"m_Type\": \"UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData\",\n    \"m_ObjectId\":
    \"0db453aea8ca4c07802e1bd24152bdaa\",\n    \"m_Title\": \"Blend Shader\",\n   
    \"m_Content\": \"I created 2 textures to used with the ground. It will be like
    a cement and have a dirty grass on the top with a random position. So, I created
    2 textures. The first one is cement thing and the second, the grass.\\n\\nFor
    each, they have base texture, AO, Normal and Smoothness. I created a simple noise
    node to random the second texture position and used it in the T of blend node\",\n   
    \"m_TextSize\": 2,\n    \"m_Theme\": 0,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\":
    \"2\",\n        \"x\": -3001.0,\n        \"y\": 207.0,\n        \"width\": 910.39013671875,\n       
