    \"ebc768b26d47407aa58b6c6e22cce18e\",\n    \"m_Title\": \"Noise Shader\",\n   
    \"m_Content\": \"I added the simple noise node that used tilling to turned the
    noise to be a random moving down line and added a remap node to make it more
    contrast to get an alpha. Then I created a Fresnel effect to got something kind
    of Rim light of the object. Combined it together with the breathing effect by
    Sine node. Alpha clipping and made it glow.\\n\",\n    \"m_TextSize\": 2,\n   
    \"m_Theme\": 0,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\n       
    \"x\": -3152.0,\n        \"y\": -190.0,\n        \"width\": 788.696044921875,\n       
